 "employee_id": "E040",
 "system_id": "crm",
 "justification": "Kevin Walsh (Driver Trainer) is starting ride-alongs at customer sites and needs access to customer contacts in the Salesdesk CRM. Requested by his manager, Chloe Dubois."
}

{
 "kind": "done",
 "message": "Hi Chloe, here's where each of the three requests stands:\n\n1. Yusuf Demir (E024), offboarding: Done (OFF-1001). His last day is set to Friday 18 December 2026. All his access (email, chat, HR portal, TMS) is removed at 17:00 local time that day. His laptop and badge must be returned within 5 business days after the last day, and IT will email a prepaid return label (POL-OFF-01).\n\n2. Yusuf BI access: Not filed. Analytics dashboards (BI) are for full-time employees only, and contractors are never eligible (POL-ACC-02). Yusuf is a contractor, so I can't request it, and I can't make an exception. For the handover reports, the way to get the data to him is through someone who already has BI access, such as a full-time colleague, who can share the outputs with him. Exceptions have to come from his department head emailing Security directly.\n\n3. Kevin Walsh (E040), CRM access: Request filed (REQ-1002) and routed to you as his manager for approval. Standard systems usually take about 1 business day. Access isn't granted until you sign off.\n\nPolicies cited: POL-OFF-01, POL-ACC-02.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-01",
  "POL-ACC-02",
  "POL-ACC-01"
 ]
}
